        "key": "B",
        "text": "improperly shaped.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "偷换概念",
        "analysis": "【干扰特征: 偷换概念】是化学成分配比不当（mix ingredients improperly），非物理形状不当（improperly shaped）。",
