    "stem": "In Ferreira's opinion, preservation of plastic artifacts",
    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "will inspire future scientific research.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "过度推断",
        "analysis": "【干扰特征: 偏离主线】教授强调的是历史考古视角与人类文明见证，非单纯启发自然科学研究。",
        "refSentences": [
