        "text": "has profound historical significance.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "distractorType": null,
        "analysis": "【正确项 · 同义替换】P7-S1 和 P7-S2 明确引述费雷拉教授的高屋建瓴观点：'archaeologists first defined great material ages of human history (Stone Age, Iron Age)... We now live in an age of plastic, and what we decide to preserve today will have a strong impact on how in the future we'll be seen'（考古学家根据博物馆文物定义石器时代铁器时代，我们身处塑料时代，今天保存的文物将决定未来后人如何审视看待我们）。B选项 has profound historical significance（具有深远的历史意义）高度凝练了这一跨越时代的文明见证价值。",
